# Synthetic movie (Cross held 6 of every 90 VBLs from VBL 300 to 1205, keyed
# on the consume key): from the title with the card holding
# BASCUS-94425SP2RR in slot 1, the game reads the save's first sector at
# boot, loads the save (one asynchronous read of 0x1400 bytes) and enters
# the level. The slot 1 card is given by the caller (--card1), the card
# games/spyro-2/oracle-card-save.conf's capture leaves.
--no-card2
